!.env.example

# v0.19.2 §23 — RUNTIME DATABASES ARE NEVER VERSIONED.
# The demo is reproducible from source: POST /api/v1/seed (or scripts/reseed-demo.ts)
# + prisma/migrations/0_init. Local files stay on disk (git rm --cached only).
db/*.db
db/*.db-journal
db/*.db-shm
db/*.db-wal
db/*.sqlite
db/*.sqlite3

